Package: SIGNAL
Type: Package
Title: Spatial varIable Gene detectioN And cLassification
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Tingting", family = "Hou", email = "tingthou@lsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Tingting Hou <tingthou@lsu.edu>
Description: Detects spatially variable genes in single-cell resolution
    spatial transcriptomics and classifies them by the source of their
    spatial variation. Each gene is modelled with a multi-kernel variance
    component model containing a cell-type kernel, a spatial kernel and their
    interaction. Variance components are estimated by MINQUE, and an overall
    test plus separate tests for the cell-type effect, the spatial effect and
    the cell-type-specific spatial (ctSVG) effect are computed with Liu's
    moment-matching approximation or Davies' exact method. P-values are
    combined across a panel of spatial kernels with the Cauchy combination
    test.
